{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "6d84f5a53648870d1504f7624ff06443b57a1ed9f937c811ec544037f0eb6cf7", "ja": "雑誌の撮影　撮影前", "zh": "杂志拍摄　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6001_p", "source_sha256": "0a7aa3e5b52f027fbcde8ded094284206598bcdd294f3b1764ad8d8267d6eb85", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影。\n昴がウサギと一緒に遊ぶ姿を撮影する予定だ！）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n计划拍摄昴和兔子一起玩耍的样子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6002_047sub", "source_sha256": "96a61d4b2fc0f3f05cfbc62c87d079ffea1c92177968db859236d9133b03ddec", "ja": "ウサギと撮影できるなんて、ワクワクするな～！\nよしっ、今日は思いっきり遊ぶぞー！", "zh": "居然能和兔子一起拍摄，真让人兴奋啊～！\n好！今天就尽情玩个痛快吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6003_p", "source_sha256": "0647375cf7e5f7ce91ecef28978ebed7e0ad68ff5fe378139a0fbee05bcb65b4", "ja": "気合いが入ってるな、昴。\nその衣装も、すごく似合ってるぞ。", "zh": "干劲十足啊，昴。\n这身服装也非常适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6004_047sub", "source_sha256": "8d23dde4a1aaec531df6f34b543dbf0ca451fa9545f7a1d9119dfa46441ffe21", "ja": "へへっ、ありがとな！　そうだ……\n{$P$}に聞きたいことがあったんだ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢！对了……\n我有件事想问{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6005_p", "source_sha256": "d3a236991fcde563c9d89b06c0c8ed966f4550ff5c239814dc064e990f54dc68", "ja": "おっ、質問か？\nいいぞ、なんでも聞いてくれ！", "zh": "哦，是有问题要问吗？\n好啊，尽管问吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6006_047sub", "source_sha256": "fa7189e0e2b6e22dbac5c996db81d11b083fee31c9156de5f37e4dac0854898d", "ja": "あのさ……ウサギと遊ぶって、どうしたらいいのかな？\nオレ、動物とか飼ったことないから、わかんなくて。", "zh": "那个……想和小兔子一起玩的话，该怎么做才好呢？\n我没养过动物之类的，完全摸不着头脑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6007_047sub", "source_sha256": "6334ec31df717a0e0d44cda5a28c0c13390f2e022b814a7bd702326bcac5d725", "ja": "一緒に遊ぶからには、ウサギにも楽しんでほしいんだ！\n{$P$}、何か知ってたら教えて！", "zh": "既然要一起玩，我也希望兔子能玩得开心！{$P$}，你要是知道什么就告诉我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6008_p", "source_sha256": "34541107efbc5486c02766b01011d3e4a47dd1ff10002f865c4ef48604ea3613", "ja": "なるほど。昴の気持ちはわかったよ。\nウサギと一緒に遊ぶなら……そうだな。", "zh": "原来如此。我明白昴的心情了。\n如果要和兔子一起玩……让我想想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6009", "source_sha256": "7c0d96b75ae0f439dc9bd3ee07fb0d9be7f6b73644aff8d520fb2b5ac6f49691", "ja": "ボールで遊ぶ", "zh": "玩球", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6010", "source_sha256": "b8bf312bf468b55bcc466dee365460cdaea63663ad9e3b50da4d4ece7e06bb89", "ja": "かけっこで遊ぶ", "zh": "玩赛跑", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6011", "source_sha256": "8d30fd22824502e65fbf3ba65697aeaf9b76d16a72d6fe786c0ea911ba2e5efa", "ja": "かじって遊ぶ", "zh": "啃着玩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6100_p", "source_sha256": "3f12280434314364b739817ea27775bdcdf3b6c56a29fd48623f2f9b93df18a9", "ja": "ボールで遊ぶのが好きだって聞いたことがあるんだ。\nそれなら、昴も一緒に楽しめるんじゃないか？", "zh": "我听说你喜欢玩球。\n这样的话，昴也能一起玩得开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6101_047sub", "source_sha256": "9cede08f847e7d5a812c70efaec63d7ec949d350aa5818d8ec4caac6e0faa825", "ja": "いいじゃん！　ボール遊びなら任せてよ！\nオレがピッチャーで、ウサギがキャッチャーで……。", "zh": "好啊！玩球就交给我吧！\n我当投手，兔子当捕手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6102_047sub", "source_sha256": "c061ee3bf20b49c180b4021ca413b0d2306a6730b10288403cfbc984d8752f58", "ja": "へへっ♪　なんか、ますます楽しみになってきた！\nオレ、ちょっとボールとグローブとってくる～！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 感觉越来越期待了！\n我去拿球和手套～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6200_p", "source_sha256": "e40d426fa65514400b9713eee62ecefb5562b83d16294a5830b0422462251fd0", "ja": "ウサギはよく走り回るらしいからな……。\n一緒にかけっこをしてみるのも手かもしれないな。", "zh": "听说兔子很喜欢到处乱跑……。\n要不要一起赛跑试试看，说不定也是个办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6201_047sub", "source_sha256": "0501391cdabbfe78f34a4b5e868e392f5929d6d9ca9a2a15afcc59991fc06730", "ja": "へぇ、かけっこかー。うん、いいかも！\nオレも体動かしたい気分だったし！", "zh": "哦，赛跑啊——嗯，好像也不错！\n我也正好想活动活动身体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6202_047sub", "source_sha256": "b1b5fba3b53f0cb8bfbf770659d9ff74c51817a7c716caae7ed5cc92c98942d8", "ja": "ウサギって、すげー速そうだけど……でもオレだって\n今はウサギだもんな！　よーし、負けないぞ～！", "zh": "兔子看起来跑得飞快……不过我现在也是兔子嘛！好——我可不会输～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6300_p", "source_sha256": "560c80d6da10ce03bf4ab2543f32dffdbde25fd9992e50a5f24df04c98f100fa", "ja": "ウサギは物をかじる習性があるそうだから、\n昴もウサギになりきって、物をかじる……とかどうだ？", "zh": "听说兔子有啃咬东西的习性，\n昴也彻底融入兔子的角色，啃咬东西……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6301_047sub", "source_sha256": "c5b1bfd7120eba0883f1cc41f9f8df4b90252a965e868bb40b58cc4b205ea6cb", "ja": "なるほどー……って、{$P$}。\nそれ、本気で言ってる？", "zh": "原来如此——等等，{$P$}。\n你是认真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_6302_047sub", "source_sha256": "c0812d15b9bb3ad00852003565894d5add943ff8e8223b682e3b06418158c2c6", "ja": "かじって遊ぶって、どうやるんだよ？\nオレ、真剣に悩んでたのに……。もう、いいよ。", "zh": "“咬一口玩”到底要怎么玩啊？\n我可是很认真地在烦恼……算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
